{"id": "t123-057", "text": "Kalani + Salma - joint birthday drinks 12th, sat after next, upstairs @ the Bell from 7. Salma's into natural wine, Kalani the bread thing. Salma's husband sorting a cake. Kalani's sister Leilani coming over from Hawaii for it, first time in 3 yrs. I said I'd help him set up at 6. get both a card + bottle of orange wine for Salma, banneton for Kalani", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint birthday drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat after next", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "natural wine", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bread thing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p7", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leilani", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Hawaii", "owner": "p7", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 3 yrs"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get both a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bottle of orange wine for Salma", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "g